WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.020
Open AI Resume Studio.

2
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:10.258
Enter your personal information, education, skills and experience.

3
00:00:10.338 --> 00:00:12.634
Choose your favorite resume template.

4
00:00:12.714 --> 00:00:17.642
Review your information and preview your professional resume before exporting.

5
00:00:17.722 --> 00:00:22.458
From the template gallery, filter across one hundred distinct layouts built

6
00:00:22.538 --> 00:00:25.925
for engineering, academic, executive, and ATS clarity.

7
00:00:26.005 --> 00:00:30.549
Click into the live two-panel editor to update your full name, headline,

8
00:00:30.629 --> 00:00:34.979
contact links, and career summary while watching the A4 sheet refresh

9
00:00:35.059 --> 00:00:36.579
instantaneously.

10
00:00:36.659 --> 00:00:41.267
Add degrees inside Education, list technical and soft competencies inside

11
00:00:41.347 --> 00:00:45.312
Skills, and record internships or work roles inside Experience.

12
00:00:45.392 --> 00:00:49.871
You can drag sections to reorder your layout, edit a profile photo with

13
00:00:49.951 --> 00:00:54.751
optional background removal, run transparent ATS quality scoring, and export

14
00:00:54.831 --> 00:00:59.053
directly as a crisp print-ready A4 PDF or high-resolution PNG file.

15
00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:00.653
Thank you for watching.
